          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<h2>Why Work With Us?</h2>",
            "title_underline_style": "none"
          }
        },
        "166005796961cc60d8-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our dedicated account managers in the Netherlands, Belgium, and Germany support our retail partners with hands-on advice, trend insights, and tailored product suggestions. You can browse and order through our easy-to-use B2B webshop — complete with rich content, seasonal trends, and curated collections, or order via EDI, app, or phone.</p><p>We make it easy for you to focus on what matters: running your business.</p>"
          }
        },
        "166005796961cc60d8-3": {
          "type": "buttons",
          "settings": {
            "show_first_link": true,
            "first_link_text": "Our brands",
